SidekickDB
https://github.com/SidekickDB/sidekick

SidekickDB is a modified version of InstantDB
(https://github.com/instantdb/instant), which was created by Instant and
its contributors and is licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0. A
copy of the license is in LICENSE.md.

SidekickDB is an independent continuation of that code. It is not
affiliated with or endorsed by Instant. "Instant" and "InstantDB" are used
here only to say where the code comes from.

Files in this repository have been changed from the original. The
intentional changes are listed in UPSTREAM.md under "Intentional
divergences". Some of them are marked with a "SidekickDB:" comment in the
file; most changed files carry no per-file marker. Every change is recorded
in the git history, which also keeps the original authors of every upstream
commit.

The admin package contains a copy of eventsource
(https://github.com/EventSource/eventsource) by Espen Hovlandsdal and
contributors, as published in the @instantdb/eventsource 4.1.0-2 package,
which adds a "messageEvent" option, with one type taken from eventsource
5.1.5. It is in client/packages/admin/src/eventsource/ in the repository and
in src/eventsource/ in the @sidekickdb/admin package, and is licensed under
the MIT License, Copyright (c) EventSource GitHub organisation. The license
text is in the LICENSE file in that directory.
